[4mID3V2[24m(1)                         User Command                         [4mID3V2[24m(1)

[1mNAME[0m
       id3v2  -   Adds/Modifies/Removes/Views id3v2 tags, converts/lists id3v1
       tags

[1mSYNOPSIS[0m
       [1mid3v2 [22m[ [4mOPTION[24m ] [ [4mFILE[24m ]

[1mOPTIONS[0m
       [1m-h, --help[0m
              Display help and exit

       [1m-f, --list-frames[0m
              Display all possible frames for id3v2

       [1m-L, --list-genres[0m
              Lists all id3v1 genres

       [1m-v, --version[0m
              Display version information and exit

       [1m-l, --list[0m
              Lists the tag(s) on the file(s)

       [1m-R, --list-rfc822[0m
              Lists using an rfc822-style format for output

       [1m-d, --delete-v2[0m
              Deletes id3v2 tags

       [1m-s, --delete-v1[0m
              Deletes id3v1 tags

       [1m-D, --delete-all[0m
               Deletes both id3v1 and id3v2 tags

       [1m-C, --convert[0m
               Converts id3v1 tag to id3v2

       [1m-a, --artist ARTIST[0m
              Set the artist information

       [1m-A, --album ALBUM[0m
              Set the album title information

       [1m-t, --song SONG[0m
              Set the song title information

       [1m-c, --comment DESCRIPTION:COMMENT[0m
              Set the comment information

       [1m-g, --genre num[0m
              Set the genre number

       [1m-y, --year num[0m
              Set the year

       [1m-T, --track num/num[0m
              Set the track number/(optional) total tracks


[1mSEE ALSO[0m
       id3tag(1), id3info(1), id3convert(1)

